# MANDATORY: MCTB PAGE BUILD SPEC — 01: OVERVIEW

**Route:** `/mctb`  
**Source of truth:** `docs/TRANSOVO-MCTB-PAGE-BUILD-SPEC-01-OVERVIEW.md`  
**Prerequisites:** All governing MCTB docs + `transovo-mctb-page-build-specs.mdc`  
**Visual baseline:** Finished Appointment product screenshots (visual only)

## When this rule activates

**Before implementing, restyling, or declaring complete** the MCTB Overview page (`/mctb`, `src/app/**/mctb/**` overview/dashboard).

## Primary job

Concise operational snapshot: **Is MCTB working? What happened? What needs attention? Where next?**

Not a duplicate Missed Calls list, Conversations inbox, Analytics report, or Setup editor.

## Page structure (top → bottom)

1. Transovo shell + MCTB local nav (Overview selected)
2. Page header (H1: Overview)
3. Critical status region — **only when necessary**
4. Primary KPI strip (Today: missed calls, recovery texts sent, replies, need reply)
5. Needs attention (authoritative reason codes)
6. Recent missed calls (~5) → View all
7. Recent conversations → Open conversations
8. Setup health (compact, links to Setup sections)
9. Performance snapshot (optional, links to Analytics)

## Header actions (state-dependent)

| State | Primary | Secondary |
|-------|---------|-----------|
| Setup incomplete | Finish setup | Test setup (if possible) |
| Paused | Resume MCTB | Manage schedule |
| Healthy | None or quiet "Manage setup" | — |

## Healthy state

Quiet: **● Active** with text. No giant green banner.

## Terminology (locked)

Missed calls | Recovery texts sent | Replies | Business line | Text-back sender | Needs attention | Suppressed | Opted out

Never: Your number, provider jargon, mock metrics, legal guarantees.

## States required

First-use/setup | Healthy active | No activity today | Paused | Messaging blocked | Partial/degraded | Loading (skeletons, not false zeros) | Error (with Retry) | Permission-limited staff

## Prohibited

- Old Voice shell or MCTB-specific global chrome
- Full setup form on Overview
- Full conversations composer
- Mock analytics / fabricated consent
- Cards around everything
- Permanent Try It / Consent Log in nav

## Data contract

Use authoritative backend for: `mctb_status`, `paused_until`, today KPIs, `needs_reply_count`, `recent_missed_calls[]`, `recent_conversations[]`, `setup_readiness`, forwarding/sender/consent/schedule state. No frontend-only state inference.

## Definition of done

See full spec §61 checklist before marking `/mctb` complete.

